;&amp;#xA;&amp;#xA;    &amp;#xA;Western Sign Finder - Sun Sign Astrology Calculator - Chinese Sign Predictor&amp;#xA;Today Sun sign for 23 July 2026: LeoToday Leo HoroscopeZodiac Sun Sign - LeoZodiac Symbol - LionLord Planet - SunSun Sign Date - July 23 To August 22Learn more about LeoToday born forecast of Leo person&amp;#xA;&amp;#xA;Sun Sign horoscope predictions - Astrology uses two types of zodiac signs, first is related to the Moon and the second to the Sun. Learn more here about - zodiac astrology. Our online western sign finder tool calculates Sun and Chinese signs by date of birth. Just enter your birth date, month and year and get your western and animal signs with the predictions.&amp;#xA;Here, you can search your rising sign and life predictions by birth date. You will get the forecast about lucky dates and numbers, the lucky direction from the birthplace, lucky gemstone and colors. You can find the Moon zodiac of your name from the Moon zodiac calculator, which can be more effective in your life according to Indian Vedic astrology.&amp;#xA;Find the Sun sign by birth date - With the online Sun sign calculator, you can calculate your western sign according to birth date. It forecasts about the rising sign traits and personality, your favorable days, stone, color and direction. The solar sign is the designation, in which the Sun stays in a horoscope. The Sun stays in each zodiac for 30 days approx. You can check Sun sign dates manually from the table.Read our interesting post about Searching for a love partner for each zodiac sign.&amp;#xA;Chinese astrology differs from Western and Indian astrology, which is based on animal signs and a twelve-year cycle. Chinese signs have an impact on each year. Animal designations of the Chinese zodiac follow the twelve-year cycle, each Chinese sign corresponds to an animal and a year. Click for a Chinese numerological yearly forecast for this year.&amp;#xA;Each Chinese New Year falls on different dates, from mid-January 